#: src/plattenalbum.py:1049
msgid ""
"To get started, install the Music Player Daemon (<tt>mpd</tt>) with your "
"system package manager, and run the following commands to configure and "
"initialize a basic local instance. After that, Plattenalbum should be able "
"to seamlessly connect to it."
msgstr ""
"Pour commencer, installez Music Player Daemon (<tt>mpd</tt>) avec votre "
"gestionnaire de paquets, et exécutez la commande suivante pour configurer et "
"initialiser une instance basique locale. Ensuite, Plattenalbum devrait s'y "
"connecter."

